{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HellBit</strong> is a roguelike about survival through positioning.<br>Your weapon swings on its own \u2014 all you control is where, when, and how you move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run drops you into a new hell, procedurally generated with enemies, traps, and brutal bosses. There are no safe spots, no perfect strategies \u2014 only sharp reflexes and risk-reward decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sword fights for you, but only if you put yourself in danger.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Automatic combat</strong> \u2013 your sword attacks on its own; success depends on your movement and positioning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural rooms</strong> \u2013 each run delivers new layouts, enemies, and traps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permadeath</strong> \u2013 die and start over; learn patterns, adapt strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Risky upgrades</strong> \u2013 shrines, curses, and fragile items with game-changing effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss encounters</strong> \u2013 unique challenges that push your mastery of movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Compact but brutal</strong> \u2013 fast runs that are endlessly replayable.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3874320?t=1757642534","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3874320?t=1757642534","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874320/e2c0b5587a2d21f7233f71f013688842ee402cae/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757642534","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874320/e2c0b5587a2d21f7233f71f013688842ee402cae/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757642534","categories":[{"description":"Sin